      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>In the name of God, the merciful and compassionate</li>\n<li>The slave of the lofty presence, the most glorious, respected, and courteous, may God perpetuate the days of its glory and elevate its stature&hellip;..and strength</li>\n<li>and doom its enemies &lt;vacat&gt; conveys his obeisance in the exalted and courteous presence, and reports to it</li>\n<li>to ask the mighty presence, may God multiply its glory, by granting them the noble decree</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
